            "review_title": "Review at Tartine Saïgon, Bà Huyện Thanh Quan, Q3",
            "review_text": "Laura T\n4 contributions\n0\nNot recommmed\nSep 2025 • Couples\nThe service was awful. We ordered 2 salmon toast but in one the egg was dropped by the waiter. He did not replace the egg nor clean the floor near our table. I ask for cold milk in my coffee and I received hot milk. We ask for no ice in our glass and when we received a glass with ice and complained, the waiter with just emptied the glass.\nBut most importantly while eating we could hear the waiter cutting his nails behind the counter! That was disgusting\nFood was ok but expensive (660.000 dong, 22€ for two salmon toast, 2 coffee and a ridiculous amount of orange juice). Way too high for Vietnam standards.\nHighly not recommended!\nRead more\nWritten September 2, 2025",
