            "review_text": "TH M\n3 contributions\n0\nOpen space, delicious food\nMay 2024 • Couples\nOpen space with outdoor and air conditioning on the upper floor, pets allowed. I came with my boyfriend and we were both satisfied with the service and food here 🥰🥰\nShow original\nWritten May 14, 2024\nOwner's R\nCảm ơn bạn!\n———————————————\nThe team of Tartine Saigon\nTᴀʀᴛɪɴᴇ Sᴀɪ̈ɢᴏɴ, sᴏᴜʀᴅᴏᴜɢʜ ʙᴀᴋᴇʀʏ-ᴄᴀғᴇ́-ʀᴇsᴛᴀᴜʀᴀɴᴛs ɪɴ sᴜɴɴʏ Sᴀɪ̈ɢᴏɴ:\n📍Tartine Saïgon 25 Nguyen Dinh Chieu, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon 215 Ly Tu Trong, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon Binh Thanh\n📍Tartine Saïgon Thao Dien, Q2\n📍Tartine Saïgon An Phu, Q2\n📍Tartine Saïgon Vista Verde, Q2\n📍Tartine Saïgon 14a Bà Huyện Thanh Quan, Q3 \n📍Tartine Saïgon PMH Mỹ Khang, Q7\n⏰ 7am-10pm, every day for dine-in & takeaway, and baking twice a day\n🍺🍹🍷🥃Happy Hour Every Day 3-7pm #Buy1Get1Free\n🛒 You can also find our breads and goodies at our partner shop\nRead more\nWritten May 23, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
