            "review_text": "Trip51929467282\n4 contributions\n0\nGood food, will come here again.\nApr 2024 • Solo\nI stopped by Tartine Saigon (district 3) for dinner. I had a pesto pasta which seemed light while eating it but surprisingly sating by the end. It was fresh and tasty.\n\nI also tried their lemon juice. They helpfully provided a small jug of sugar syrup so that I could control the level of sweetness.\n\nMy final treat was their mousse which was surprisingly dense and rich. I quite enjoyed it.\n\nStaff were attentive, fast and helpful.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 26, 2024\nOwner's R\nThanks for your visit and good words. See you again soon!\n———————————————\nThe team of Tartine Saigon\nTᴀʀᴛɪɴᴇ Sᴀɪ̈ɢᴏɴ, sᴏᴜʀᴅᴏᴜɢʜ ʙᴀᴋᴇʀʏ-ᴄᴀғᴇ́-ʀᴇsᴛᴀᴜʀᴀɴᴛs ɪɴ sᴜɴɴʏ Sᴀɪ̈ɢᴏɴ:\n📍Tartine Saïgon 25 Nguyen Dinh Chieu, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon 215 Ly Tu Trong, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon Binh Thanh\n📍Tartine Saïgon Thao Dien, Q2\n📍Tartine Saïgon An Phu, Q2\n📍Tartine Saïgon Vista Verde, Q2\n📍Tartine Saïgon 14a Bà Huyện Thanh Quan, Q3 \n📍Tartine Saïgon PMH Mỹ Khang, Q7\n⏰ 7am-10pm, every day for dine-in & takeaway, and baking twice a day\n🍺🍹🍷🥃Happy Hour Every Day 3-7pm #Buy1Get1Free\n🛒 You can also find our breads and goodies at our partner shop\nRead more\nWritten May 23, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
